    "Original old method SHA and all 687 protected source files plus that method join the frozen tail-source projection exactly, including byte sizes from Git metadata. The inherited687 Git blob identities match original dd211.",
    "Both full handoff maps contain every original 746 input record unchanged, including built ELF 1e79e2f0 and original input 444f7532. The original frozen-map hash c7b68b06 is preserved separately.",
    "Only read-only original helper functions are reused after source guards: contract.prefix_contract and handoff.route_records/validate_manifest/route_projection/part_manifest. No oldlive_route or restore function is called. Original prefix semantics retain 1691 fixed clocks, timing 20/4/8/8 ns plus 5 percent, and original three shorts.",
    "Complete metadata provides no new evidence that archived native bytes still extract successfully. Full archive verification and source-bound native audit execution remain future hosted requirements."
  ],
